<title>USA: Bellevue Fire Dist 9, N.Y., won by Roosevelt.</title>
<headline>Bellevue Fire Dist 9, N.Y., won by Roosevelt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross, Inc., said it won $3.217 million of Bellevue Fire District No 9, N.Y., fire district serial bonds, 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.47 percent.</p>
</text>
